            "created_at": "2025-08-27T10:09:01.904816+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 3 is a big round for brig. This is the power swing round where brig can deal huge burst damage in one combo. \n\nThe main combo is M1 (w/ Skold boomerang) + Shield Bash + Animation cancel bash w/ Whipshot + M1 (w/ Skoldd boomerang). This will be your up close burst damage and can deal +330 damage with this combo.\n\nWe take  [Chain Extender](item_0a0d50dc-0ec9-42f6-a0ad-c373eb44dc6d) here to maximise our options when not in burst damage range which will combo nicely with  [God Ray](item_4abb5cdb-f113-4f21-aa0a-e67d95a11fd0).\n\nWhipshot with  [Chain Extender](item_0a0d50dc-0ec9-42f6-a0ad-c373eb44dc6d)  will be 30meter range while [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) boomerang has a range of 25m. Both will benefit greatly from  [God Ray](item_4abb5cdb-f113-4f21-aa0a-e67d95a11fd0)",
