            "created_at": "2025-08-27T10:09:01.904816+00:00",
            "notes": "At this point we have a few options in terms of items but generally it falls into 3 categories\n\n*More Survivability*\n [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) will make you unkillable\n\n*More Burst*\n [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) or  [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) will go nicely with your burst combo and can help you secure squishies better\n\n*Utility*\n [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) since you have lots of ability damage and damage over time thanks to  [God Ray](item_4abb5cdb-f113-4f21-aa0a-e67d95a11fd0) , applying healing reduction is very for long periods of time is very valuable and easy to do. \n\nPersonally I will lean to damage build and give for  [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb)",
